{"id":"00411","root":"uni00411_1","name":{"ja":"アンリード・ボニー","en":"Annreed Bonnie"},"title":{"ja":"【クリスマス】","en":"【Christmas】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【クリスマス】 アンリード・ボニー","en":"【Christmas】 Annreed Bonnie"},"element":"Science","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2020-12-15","limited":true,"characterId":167,"profile":{"ja":"魔界で“死神のアンリード”と名を轟かせる魔族のガンマンにして賞金稼ぎ。人間界から流入した科学と、魔界の技術によって生み出された特別なリボルバー拳銃“ジェットリボルバー”が得物で、装甲車にも穴をあけるほどの魔法銃弾を撃つ。体のあちこちに魔繍と呼ばれる魔術的な刺青を施していて、この魔繍のうちいくつかはシュヴァリエが施したもの。魔繍はその力を発動させる時にだけ体に浮かび上がるため、普段その刺青を見る事はできない。彼女が多用している魔繍、例えば“ジャック・ローズ”は太ももに浮かぶ薔薇の刺青で、一定の間、驚異的なスピードをアンリードに与える。人間界のクリスマスを大きく勘違いしたアンリードは、下腹部に“異性を誘惑する”効果があるという“チャーミング・ハート”の魔繍を浮かべて祭りを楽しんでいる。","en":"She is a demon-world gunslinger and bounty hunter known as the \"Reaper of Annreed.\" She wields the Jet Revolver, a special revolver pistol forged from human-world science and demon-world technology that fires magical bullets capable of piercing armored vehicles. Her body is marked with mystical tattoos called ma-shuu, some of which were applied by Chevalier. These tattoos only appear when their power is activated, so they're normally invisible. One of her frequently used ma-shuu, \"Jack Rose,\" manifests as a rose tattoo on her thigh and grants Annreed extraordinary speed for a short time."},"illustrator":"Sian","voiceActor":"高梨はなみ","forms":[{"id":"uni00411_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[964,1928],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[147,294],"def":[127,254],"spd":[76,76],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["5","880007"]},{"id":"uni00411_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1428,2856],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[229,458],"def":[189,378],"spd":[76,76],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["5","880007","880008"]},{"id":"uni00411_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1892,3799],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[316,633],"def":[256,510],"spd":[76,76],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["5","880007","880008"]}],"skills":{"5":{"sl